<div class="genai-container">
    <header class="genai-spacer-3">
        <h1>Prompt Engineering: Types of Messages — System, User, AI (Assistant)</h1>
        <p class="genai-lead">Understand how System, User, and Assistant messages work together. Learn their purpose, structure, and best practices with realistic examples and ready-to-use templates.</p>
    </header>

    <nav class="genai-toc">
        <div class="genai-fw-semibold genai-spacer-2">On this page</div>
        <ol>
            <li><a href="#introduction">Introduction</a></li>
            <li><a href="#syntax">Message Structure &amp; Syntax</a></li>
            <li><a href="#example">Examples</a></li>
            <li><a href="#explanation">How the Roles Interact</a></li>
            <li><a href="#realworld">Real-World Use Cases</a></li>
            <li><a href="#notes">Key Notes / Tips</a></li>
            <li><a href="#practice">Practice Exercise</a></li>
            <li><a href="#summary">Summary</a></li>
            <li><a href="#templates">Copy-Paste Templates</a></li>
            <li><a href="#checklist">Quality Checklist</a></li>
